Infuse yourself with the raging fury of the Sun, increasing your physical and spell critical chance by [2%, 4%, 6%, 8%, 10% (TL1-5)].

Each time you crit with a physical attack or a spell you have [34%, 49%, 58%, 64%, 69% (TL1-5)] chance to gain Sun's Vengeance for 2 turns.

While affected by Sun's Vengeance, your Sun Ray will take no time to use and will deal 25% more damage.

If Sun Ray was on cooldown, the remaining turns are reduced by one instead.

This effect can only happen once per turn.
